abstract: >
  Code reproducing all figures, tables and analyses of the TRACE study: an
  auditable simulation (OMICS-SIM cohort, non-circular patient-level validation,
  circularity and adversarial tests, label-free calibration surrogate, baselines
  and provenance sensitivity) and real-data validation on open-access cohorts:
  TCGA and METABRIC breast-cancer gene expression, and TCGA glioma DNA methylation
  across sequencing plates. A methods study, not a clinical validation.
